  "sentences": [
    {"text": "A fine, misty drizzle hung in the air, too light to fall.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Soft, steady rain pattered on the leaves, and the whole garden seemed to drink.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "Torrential, lashing rain hammered on the roof until they had to shout to be heard.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Driving sheets of rain swept across the valley, one after another, like grey curtains.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "The first fat, heavy raindrops spattered the pavement and released the smell of dust.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Swollen, overflowing gutters gushed into the street.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The glistening, rain-washed streets reflected the street lamps in long, trembling streaks.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "All afternoon a grey, relentless downpour streamed down the windowpane.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "Low, bruised clouds massed on the horizon.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Tiny, silver droplets beaded the spider's web.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "The rain came down so hard that it bounced off the tarmac.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Deep, muddy puddles pooled in every hollow of the lane.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The icy, stinging rain soaked him to the skin within a minute.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Water dripped from the brim of his hat and ran down his collar.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "Long after the storm had passed, the water gurgled in the drains.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "A faint, shimmering rainbow arched over the rooftops.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "By evening the storm had eased to a drizzle.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The clean, earthy smell of wet soil rose from the flower beds.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The cloudburst turned the lane into a river in less than five minutes.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "Rain lashed the windows and drummed on the dustbin lids.", "vibe": "Wild"},
    {"text": "It drizzled all weekend, and the world shrank to the size of one room.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "She stood at the bus stop in the rain, watching other people's lights go by.", "vibe": "Lonely"},
    {"text": "The sky darkened to the colour of slate, and the first drops fell like a warning.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Rain ran down the back of his neck, cold as a fingertip.", "vibe": "Menacing"},
    {"text": "Every leaf glistened, and the air tasted as if it had been washed.", "vibe": "Beautiful"},
    {"text": "He fell asleep to the sound of rain on the tent.", "vibe": "Peaceful"},
    {"text": "The children splashed through every puddle on the way home.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Umbrellas bloomed along the street like sudden flowers.", "vibe": "Lively"},
    {"text": "Rivulets trickled down the path and joined at the gate.", "vibe": "General"},
    {"text": "The deluge had turned the pitch to mud.", "vibe": "General"}
